["Golden Retriever","₹20,000 – ₹60,000","Intelligent, gentle companion"],
["German Shepherd","₹20,000 – ₹75,000","Loyal, protective guard dog"],
["Beagle","₹15,000 – ₹40,000","Active, compact size"],
