["Pomeranian / Indian Spitz","₹5,000 – ₹25,000","Small, energetic"],
["Siberian Husky","₹40,000 – ₹1,00,000","Requires cooler climate / high care"],
["Indian Pariah Dog (Indie)","Free – ₹3,000","Resilient, low maintenance"]
